        "text": "These lighting styles aim to replicate natural, believable light or evoke the refined, motivated setups seen in film. From the soft glow of daylight to the bold contrasts of low-key lighting, these techniques prioritize realism, storytelling, and emotional nuance. They’re ideal for use in AI-generated scenes that want to feel grounded, cinematic, or timeless."
